      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 13
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD stands up to contend, and stands to judge the peoples.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 변론하러 일어나시며 백성들을 심판하려고 서시도다",
      "source_text_hash": "ac239dd788497ff0e7434310972690778157961a43ba6e4a4267388082b30e78",
      "translation_text_hash": "df46ae16df6a90c66feb2e9e3436ede6008a1f00b6d305683af486b766784231",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "여호와께서 변론하러 일어나시며 백성들을 심판하려고 서시도다"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "df46ae16df6a90c66feb2e9e3436ede6008a1f00b6d305683af486b766784231"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:ISA:3:14",
      "sequence": 17722,
