      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "ISA",
          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 14
        }
      ],
      "en": "The LORD will enter into judgment with the elders of his people and their leaders: “It is you who have eaten up the vineyard. The plunder of the poor is in your houses.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 그 백성의 장로들과 방백들을 국문하시되 포도원을 삼킨 자는 너희며 가난한 자에게서 탈취한 물건은 너희 집에 있도다",
      "source_text_hash": "e20ac1cb35c47cc13c5c88553a87a9b229eaf2a4ec35cdd76b35477348506c06",
      "translation_text_hash": "2233fca467798341479a615d557c8a3835ec753869bba02766a13931e1dfb4f0",
